WEBVTT

00:00:22.110 --> 00:00:22.370
The wings that do not flap

00:00:24.470 --> 00:00:29.260
The name is Jet

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:31.960
Sklanda

00:00:34.860 --> 00:00:36.160
Cochina Moe

00:00:37.310 --> 00:00:38.970
Raging Gazeto

00:00:40.240 --> 00:00:41.760
Sklanda

00:00:46.040 --> 00:00:47.320
Talking Boos

00:01:00.000 --> 00:01:03.610
My things are everyone's

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:11.460
That's right, Z

00:02:04.280 --> 00:02:06.040
If it's hot today, it's gonna be so hot!

00:02:06.820 --> 00:02:11.120
Boss! Let's swim together!

00:02:11.380 --> 00:02:12.460
It feels so good!

00:02:13.440 --> 00:02:13.540
Huh?

00:02:14.150 --> 00:02:17.750
I'm not in a good condition today, so I don't feel like swimming, you bastard!

00:02:18.190 --> 00:02:21.530
Boss, if you're scared of the water, you'll be better at swimming, right?

00:02:21.690 --> 00:02:23.770
I'm not scared! I'm just in a bad condition!

00:02:24.730 --> 00:02:26.010
Oh, that's bad!

00:02:26.350 --> 00:02:29.500
You're making fun of me!

00:02:30.990 --> 00:02:32.530
It won't rain for a long time, will it?

00:02:35.220 --> 00:02:46.100
S-s-s-s-s-save me!

00:02:46.740 --> 00:02:48.280
S-s-s-s-s-s-save me!

00:03:00.700 --> 00:03:01.940
Boss, isn't it going to rain?

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:05.240
Rain is good, but thunder is no good!

00:03:06.040 --> 00:03:09.820
Hold on tight so that thunder doesn't catch your navel, boss!

00:03:10.120 --> 00:03:11.800
Boss's navel is especially big.

00:03:12.240 --> 00:03:16.640
Oh, it's gone.

00:03:53.550 --> 00:03:59.860
What are you doing? Get up!

00:04:00.150 --> 00:04:03.080
What's wrong with you?

00:04:03.460 --> 00:04:04.040
What's wrong with you?

00:04:04.200 --> 00:04:06.280
I think I saw a machine gun in the rain.

00:04:06.460 --> 00:04:07.380
I think I saw a machine gun in the rain.

00:04:07.380 --> 00:04:09.540
I lost my mind because of the thunder.

00:04:09.580 --> 00:04:11.560
I can't see it clearly.

00:04:12.520 --> 00:04:28.540
It was a great thunder.

00:04:28.920 --> 00:04:29.980
It was a great thunder.

00:04:30.000 --> 00:04:33.300
Who are you?

00:04:33.340 --> 00:04:37.640
The end of this world is coming.

00:04:38.390 --> 00:04:39.190
What did you say?

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:41.410
A prophet will be resurrected from the grave.

00:04:41.410 --> 00:04:43.830
And it will spread misfortune all over the world.

00:04:44.430 --> 00:04:45.480
Who are you?

00:04:45.820 --> 00:04:49.280
I will tell you the end of this world.

00:04:50.020 --> 00:04:55.170
From the sky, sea and land, the Great Dark General will attack.

00:04:55.870 --> 00:04:58.060
And it will destroy cities all over the world.

00:04:58.620 --> 00:04:59.970
The end of this world will come.

00:05:00.000 --> 00:05:01.400
I've come all the way here.

00:05:02.360 --> 00:05:04.720
There is only one person who can face the Great Shogun of the Dark.

00:05:06.100 --> 00:05:07.560
W-what is that?

00:05:07.860 --> 00:05:10.220
It's the White of Black and White, Majinger Z.

00:05:10.800 --> 00:05:17.480
It disappeared?

00:05:30.410 --> 00:05:35.020
If I was taking a shower, it would be rude for you to come in all of a sudden!

00:05:35.480 --> 00:05:36.720
You're such a ridiculous person!

00:05:37.220 --> 00:05:38.660
I want to take a shower too.

00:05:38.980 --> 00:05:42.040
I'm not here to see Sayaka-san's nude because I like her.

00:05:42.300 --> 00:05:43.080
This is bad!

00:05:43.840 --> 00:05:44.440
Echi!

00:05:44.730 --> 00:05:45.050
Goodbye!

00:05:47.140 --> 00:05:49.400
Hey, Kakao-dou! What are you doing?

00:05:52.930 --> 00:05:54.010
Don't laugh!

00:05:54.930 --> 00:05:57.650
The prophecy is that the end of this world will come soon!

00:05:58.210 --> 00:05:59.600
Boss, you're talking about sleep.

00:06:00.000 --> 00:06:03.850
That's enough. The sky is blue, and the birds are singing in peace.

00:06:04.900 --> 00:06:06.530
Boss, didn't you see it in your dream?

00:06:07.230 --> 00:06:08.610
In this heat, it's impossible for the boss to come.

00:06:09.410 --> 00:06:12.270
It's not a dream. I saw it with my eyes. I heard it with my ears.

00:07:54.800 --> 00:07:54.960
I don't know how to dance.

00:08:00.670 --> 00:08:03.620
From now on, let's go to the sea and swim in the wind.

00:08:04.180 --> 00:08:04.960
Sounds good!

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.550
Kabuto, what's wrong with Shiro?

00:08:07.210 --> 00:08:08.400
He went shopping for his birthday.

00:08:09.600 --> 00:08:11.290
Whose birthday is it?

00:08:11.410 --> 00:08:12.760
What are you talking about?

00:08:12.900 --> 00:08:14.560
It's Kojiku's birthday today.

00:08:15.060 --> 00:08:16.600
No, it's too hot and I forgot.

00:08:16.960 --> 00:08:19.420
Furi, you're the one who's hot and crazy.

00:08:22.000 --> 00:08:23.720
We have emergency news.

00:08:25.330 --> 00:08:27.200
Suddenly, from the sky, land and sea,

00:08:27.380 --> 00:08:29.130
a huge robot army has appeared.

00:08:29.130 --> 00:08:29.390
Thank you for watching!

00:08:30.220 --> 00:08:33.720
The big cities of New York, Paris, London, and Moscow have suffered a devastating blow.

00:08:34.360 --> 00:08:34.900
Koji!

00:08:35.180 --> 00:08:36.730
Kabuto, look at that!

00:08:36.750 --> 00:08:39.030
What the prophet said has happened in reality!

00:08:48.750 --> 00:08:51.850
New York, Paris, London, and Moscow have been destroyed.

00:08:52.350 --> 00:08:53.630
Only Tokyo is left in charge of my operation.

00:08:55.370 --> 00:08:57.820
All right, I will destroy them thoroughly.

00:08:58.100 --> 00:08:59.720
The fighting army has arrived!

00:09:00.000 --> 00:09:00.800
You

00:09:30.510 --> 00:09:30.670
Teacher!

00:09:31.050 --> 00:09:33.630
I got it. Please contact me immediately.

00:09:34.360 --> 00:09:36.200
Koji, something terrible has happened.

00:09:37.070 --> 00:09:39.480
Father, Tokyo will be in danger next time, won't it?

00:09:39.930 --> 00:09:44.240
Yes. Koji, why don't you let the Majin Gazette go out and patrol it?

00:09:44.680 --> 00:09:45.960
Leave it to me.

00:09:46.260 --> 00:09:53.880
Shiro, hurry up! That guy is after us!

00:10:02.650 --> 00:10:12.800
The position of the hit is a skill and the power of the jet is a magic z.

00:10:14.290 --> 00:10:21.990
In this unbearable world, the magic goes.

00:10:22.270 --> 00:10:23.340
I shoot evil in search of it.

00:10:30.410 --> 00:10:30.770
I'm coming in!

00:10:32.940 --> 00:10:59.390
G-Nin flying object approaching!

00:11:00.000 --> 00:11:06.240
All researchers, enter emergency mode!

00:11:06.700 --> 00:11:08.620
Father, I'll let you go out!

00:11:30.320 --> 00:11:30.580
We'll be right back.

00:12:10.080 --> 00:12:15.070
I had to pee in front of people to keep my body fresh.

00:12:15.870 --> 00:12:16.590
Is it bad?

00:12:17.010 --> 00:12:17.840
Oh my!

00:12:31.720 --> 00:12:33.230
Rai, running away is cowardly!

00:12:33.430 --> 00:12:34.310
Fight the Boss Borot!

00:12:35.090 --> 00:12:36.720
We're going to attack Tokyo!

00:12:36.980 --> 00:12:56.410
There's a Majinger Z here!

00:12:56.870 --> 00:12:58.640
Tokyo won't let you do whatever you want!

00:13:00.000 --> 00:13:02.990
I've been beating around the bush, and the mecha-monster has spoken!

00:13:03.570 --> 00:13:04.450
With this, I'll...

00:13:04.450 --> 00:13:04.810
Take this!

00:13:05.250 --> 00:13:13.580
I'll lure them out!

00:13:13.620 --> 00:13:15.920
And I'll kill them with the Slava that's waiting for me in the sea!

00:13:55.720 --> 00:13:56.720
I'm the one who's in charge of this place!

00:13:56.760 --> 00:13:58.000
You're the one who's in charge of this place!

00:14:59.050 --> 00:14:59.230
Go!

00:14:59.310 --> 00:14:59.510
Go!

00:15:00.000 --> 00:15:04.460
Kikko, protect Gantelli. You guys go to the high-power research center and destroy it!

00:15:05.200 --> 00:15:07.520
Hehe, let's go report the success of the mission right away!

00:15:08.940 --> 00:15:16.730
What's wrong? Answer me!

00:15:17.070 --> 00:15:19.250
Damn it!

00:15:19.430 --> 00:15:24.060
This is a robot, isn't it? It's as easy as twisting a baby's hand, isn't it?

00:15:59.790 --> 00:15:59.910
he

00:16:00.000 --> 00:16:28.530
The poison of Jalaga will dissolve all metals.

00:16:30.000 --> 00:16:31.880
I won't let you get away with this!

00:16:31.880 --> 00:16:32.680
What?!

00:16:32.680 --> 00:16:33.740
Take this!

00:16:34.240 --> 00:16:36.180
What?!

00:17:30.220 --> 00:17:30.620
Oh, no!

00:17:37.850 --> 00:17:38.390
You bastard!

00:17:39.850 --> 00:17:48.450
I'm going to kill you!

00:17:49.380 --> 00:17:50.730
Okay, okay, okay!

00:17:50.850 --> 00:17:51.150
The end!

00:18:12.890 --> 00:18:14.270
Get close to them and evacuate immediately!

00:18:14.290 --> 00:18:17.380
Sayaka! Sayaka!

00:18:17.460 --> 00:18:18.110
It's dangerous!

00:18:18.350 --> 00:18:19.700
Go with the boss and evacuate immediately!

00:18:32.460 --> 00:18:40.040
Shiro-kun, let's evacuate.

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.520
I forgot my present!

00:19:03.960 --> 00:19:06.660
Shiro, watch out! Give it back!

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:34.260
White-nose!

00:19:35.620 --> 00:19:43.400
Let's go!

00:19:43.640 --> 00:19:52.940
What's wrong with Jiro?

00:20:03.930 --> 00:20:08.090
Don't die! Die!

00:20:09.080 --> 00:20:09.900
Iron Cutter!

00:20:10.300 --> 00:20:12.700
Southern Cross Knife!

00:20:13.270 --> 00:20:14.310
Rocket Punch!

00:20:19.920 --> 00:20:22.560
Eyebrow Beam!

00:20:30.444 --> 00:20:31.584
Press the wire!

00:21:01.310 --> 00:21:07.290
Shiro! Shiro!

00:21:07.330 --> 00:21:11.300
Shiro-chan went back to get the food she wanted to give you.

00:21:11.680 --> 00:21:12.520
And now she's like this.

00:21:12.800 --> 00:21:14.710
What's going on with Shiro?

00:21:15.150 --> 00:21:17.740
It's dangerous if we don't get rid of her right away.

00:21:18.830 --> 00:21:21.850
Let's bring a doctor with the same blood type as Shiro-kun.

00:21:22.440 --> 00:21:25.930
My blood type is the same as Shiro's.

00:21:26.400 --> 00:21:27.580
Please get rid of her right away.

00:21:27.940 --> 00:21:29.790
Koji-kun, you're...

00:21:30.000 --> 00:21:33.050
He's exhausted. He can't take his blood now, can he?

00:21:33.210 --> 00:21:35.200
He'll be fine. Doctor, please!

00:22:23.360 --> 00:22:24.700
SHIRO! MARUNDA!

00:22:24.720 --> 00:22:25.920
Don't die!

00:22:26.240 --> 00:22:27.590
Don't die!

00:22:27.910 --> 00:22:28.150
No!

00:22:30.640 --> 00:22:30.800
You can do it!

00:22:30.960 --> 00:22:41.670
The surgery is over.

00:22:42.940 --> 00:22:45.140
How is Shiro?

00:22:46.240 --> 00:22:49.420
I hope he recovers his consciousness soon.

00:22:49.920 --> 00:22:50.920
Shiro...

00:23:09.820 --> 00:23:11.240
Even so, it's a terrible wound.

00:23:11.540 --> 00:23:12.840
I can't believe it's going to dissolve.

00:23:13.880 --> 00:23:16.860
This will take time to repair.

00:23:17.140 --> 00:23:21.700
If we get attacked now, it will be the end of the research institute and all of Japan.

00:23:22.300 --> 00:23:23.170
Who are the enemies?

00:23:38.890 --> 00:23:40.860
Father, I'm sorry. It happened while I was with you.

00:23:42.600 --> 00:23:43.580
It's okay, boss.

00:23:49.020 --> 00:23:51.280
The end of this world will come soon.

00:23:52.100 --> 00:23:53.550
It's a prophet's voice!

00:23:53.870 --> 00:23:54.050
What?

00:24:01.760 --> 00:24:06.300
Oh, it's you!

00:24:08.920 --> 00:24:10.560
Kouto Kouji.

00:24:10.820 --> 00:24:12.190
Who are you?

00:24:12.530 --> 00:24:15.940
I was sent to this world to report the crisis of the world.

00:24:16.380 --> 00:24:17.400
What did you say?

00:24:17.580 --> 00:24:19.860
Unfortunately, all the cities in the world have been destroyed.

00:24:20.880 --> 00:24:23.140
Tokyo was also attacked by Kouto Kouji.

00:24:23.340 --> 00:24:24.920
Your activities prevented the destruction.

00:24:25.760 --> 00:24:29.200
However, those who were obsessed with it led a large army and attacked again.

00:24:30.760 --> 00:24:31.520
Who are they?

00:24:33.950 --> 00:24:36.050
The Dark Great Shogun of Mikene.

00:24:36.090 --> 00:24:37.780
What? The Dark Great Shogun?

00:24:38.100 --> 00:24:42.020
And the Seven Battleships of the Dark Great Shogun.

00:24:42.020 --> 00:24:46.540
When the Dark Great Shogun conquers the world, the heavens and the earth will be dark.

00:24:46.850 --> 00:24:48.790
The Mazinger Z will experience the pain of death.

00:24:49.870 --> 00:24:53.120
Can you predict my future?

00:24:53.780 --> 00:24:56.220
You will become a cross-eyed and fly in the sky.

00:24:56.680 --> 00:24:56.900
No!

00:24:57.560 --> 00:24:59.240
I will fly in the sky!

00:25:00.220 --> 00:25:04.820
It's gone.

00:25:05.850 --> 00:25:06.750
What? A prophet?

00:25:07.190 --> 00:25:11.480
He said that the Seven Armies are under the control of the Dark Great Shogun.

00:25:11.880 --> 00:25:13.800
The Dark Great Shogun?

00:25:14.300 --> 00:25:16.000
Is there something in your heart, Father?

00:25:16.000 --> 00:25:20.890
Koji, before your grandfather, Dr. Kabuto Juzo died, he left a strange message.

00:25:22.090 --> 00:25:24.250
The seven kinds of robots that sleep in the underground.

00:25:24.560 --> 00:25:29.980
Humans, animals, birds, fish, insects, reptiles, evil spirits, and...

00:25:30.000 --> 00:25:31.460
No, it's the Great Shogun of Darkness.

00:25:32.680 --> 00:25:35.950
It seems that there is a key to solve the mystery.

00:25:36.310 --> 00:25:38.260
Let's investigate Dr. Kabuto's whereabouts.

00:26:03.070 --> 00:26:06.060
Great General Han Koku!

00:26:06.120 --> 00:26:07.100
Great General Han Koku!

00:26:07.320 --> 00:26:11.740
The Great General Han Koku has arrived!

00:26:12.500 --> 00:26:19.740
Great General Han Koku, please rejoice!

00:26:20.340 --> 00:26:21.420
Tokyo will be destroyed!

00:26:21.820 --> 00:26:22.580
Don't say that!

00:26:23.300 --> 00:26:24.880
That's why I, the pride of the Seven Corps,

00:26:25.120 --> 00:26:26.780
Vardian Jalaga, Rai Gon,

00:26:26.900 --> 00:26:27.840
have defeated you!

00:26:28.160 --> 00:26:28.520
Yes!

00:26:30.000 --> 00:26:32.710
Goukon Taiko, why were you sent to the ground?

00:26:33.670 --> 00:26:38.370
I was sent to report all the events on the ground to the Dark Great Shogun-sama.

00:26:38.370 --> 00:26:41.460
You reported it? That's what you did!

00:26:42.660 --> 00:26:43.940
What is the robot that defeated my machine gun?

00:26:45.780 --> 00:26:52.880
I'm sorry. That's the robot that Dr. Hell has been struggling with all this time, called the Mazinger Z.

00:26:52.900 --> 00:26:55.730
Why are you keeping it a secret? You fool!

00:26:56.370 --> 00:26:57.750
Please forgive me!

00:26:57.970 --> 00:26:59.500
In front of my seven troops,

00:27:00.000 --> 00:27:02.440
Those who stand in our way are unforgivable, no matter how many people there are!

00:27:02.960 --> 00:27:05.920
The Seven Corpses are invincible!

00:27:10.040 --> 00:27:22.680
Jyuma!

00:27:22.960 --> 00:27:24.340
Are you deaf?

00:27:31.820 --> 00:27:34.800
Juma Shogun, you will be appointed as the Commander-in-Chief.

00:27:34.860 --> 00:27:38.450
Go to the west from the seven camps and crush the Maginger Z.

00:27:39.690 --> 00:27:40.250
Yes, sir!

00:27:40.800 --> 00:27:44.400
We, the Mikene people, will live on the ground for a long time and plant the sun's light.

00:27:45.060 --> 00:27:48.990
To do that, we will conquer the ground and bring back the sun's light.

00:27:49.710 --> 00:27:52.750
Leave it to me, Great Shogun of Darkness.

00:27:52.770 --> 00:27:55.650
Huh? The ancient Mikene people?

00:27:56.130 --> 00:27:58.420
Father, didn't the Mikene people perish?

00:28:00.000 --> 00:28:01.200
That's what the general public believed.

00:28:02.240 --> 00:28:04.200
However, according to Dr. Kabuto Juzo's research,

00:28:06.540 --> 00:28:08.380
the ancient Mikene people led by the Dark Great Shogun

00:28:08.380 --> 00:28:09.360
are hiding somewhere underground along with seven troops.

00:28:11.100 --> 00:28:13.000
It is predicted that there is a possibility that they are waiting for the time of resurrection.

00:28:14.160 --> 00:28:15.600
The predictor also said the same thing.

00:28:16.180 --> 00:28:19.260
Well, if this is the truth, then we should be afraid.

00:28:19.980 --> 00:28:21.780
Damn it!

00:28:22.120 --> 00:28:23.400
I don't care if it's Shogun or Gensui,

00:28:23.720 --> 00:28:25.360
but I can't let them do whatever they want!

00:28:27.000 --> 00:28:28.240
We don't have any means to defeat them.

00:28:30.120 --> 00:28:30.800
There's the Mazinger Z!

00:28:31.960 --> 00:28:33.920
And my boss Borot is also alive!

00:28:34.360 --> 00:28:36.380
I'm going to crush them all!

00:28:36.580 --> 00:28:39.220
The Mazinger Z will take time to repair.

00:28:39.320 --> 00:28:40.620
At this rate, it will be useless.

00:28:41.280 --> 00:28:43.540
Koji should understand.

00:28:44.260 --> 00:28:49.960
What about Japan? What about the world?

00:29:06.720 --> 00:29:10.100
The Mazinger Z is wounded. Show them the power of the Seven Battalions of the Mikene Dark General.

00:29:13.280 --> 00:29:18.510
Then defeat the Mazinger Z and kill all the people of the world to make the sun shine on the top of the Mikene people.

00:29:33.160 --> 00:29:35.340
Chief, Mikene's combat gun has appeared!

00:29:35.620 --> 00:29:35.880
What?

00:29:36.180 --> 00:29:37.770
It's aiming at Japan from the sky and the sea!

00:29:39.430 --> 00:29:59.850
Thank you.

00:30:00.000 --> 00:30:04.660
Grandpa, the seven armies of the Great Shogun of the Dark Realm have finally attacked.

00:30:05.700 --> 00:30:07.740
But the Mazinger Z is injured.

00:30:08.360 --> 00:30:10.750
But we can't just sit around and do nothing.

00:30:11.010 --> 00:30:15.640
The Mazinger Z must go out in order to destroy the Great Shogun of the Dark Realm's ambitions.

00:30:17.460 --> 00:30:22.110
To be honest, I'm scared to go out.

00:30:22.510 --> 00:30:28.370
But I'll risk my life with the Mazinger Z.

00:30:30.920 --> 00:30:32.480
Please forgive my selfishness for wandering in the middle of life and death and leaving Shiro behind.

00:30:54.060 --> 00:30:55.820
Kouji-kun, Shiro-kun is conscious!

00:30:56.490 --> 00:30:58.080
Shiro!

00:31:00.220 --> 00:31:01.670
Shiro! Shiro!

00:31:01.970 --> 00:31:06.020
Your present...

00:31:08.120 --> 00:31:08.880
Get well soon!

00:31:09.060 --> 00:31:12.620
Sensei, please take care of Shiro!

00:31:12.740 --> 00:31:21.320
Shiro, don't be reckless like your big brother.

00:31:21.720 --> 00:31:23.290
The 8th

00:31:30.600 --> 00:31:31.120
Please let me go out!

00:31:31.480 --> 00:31:34.280
The repair of the Mazinger Z is not finished yet!

00:31:34.690 --> 00:31:35.830
We can't wait for the repair to be completed!

00:31:36.810 --> 00:31:40.420
Koji, you've lost a lot of blood and your body is weak.

00:31:41.090 --> 00:31:42.650
Now, going out means death.

00:31:43.410 --> 00:31:44.500
I'm ready.

00:31:45.160 --> 00:31:48.590
If I don't go out now, the world will become the Great Shogun of Darkness.

00:31:49.190 --> 00:31:50.610
Fight! Fight!

00:31:51.260 --> 00:31:54.030
Even so, if it doesn't work, I'll just die with the Mazinger Z!

00:31:55.390 --> 00:31:56.640
Koji!

00:32:01.980 --> 00:32:08.640
When my friends call me with tears

00:32:08.640 --> 00:32:12.490
I'll talk to you later!

00:32:12.690 --> 00:32:15.710
This is a present for you, Shiro.

00:32:24.240 --> 00:32:25.560
And then...

00:32:25.560 --> 00:32:29.420
A rainbow...

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:33.570
Majin Go

00:32:33.570 --> 00:32:45.440
Thank you

00:33:14.620 --> 00:33:15.940
To wake me up in the light of the sun...

00:33:15.940 --> 00:33:17.700
It's a monster!

00:33:43.260 --> 00:33:45.580
JET SCRANDER!

00:34:00.000 --> 00:34:06.410
Manga Z

00:34:23.040 --> 00:34:23.980
HAHAHAHAHA

00:34:23.980 --> 00:34:25.420
You've been caught, you monster!

00:34:25.720 --> 00:34:26.910
Koushi no Gupiii!

00:34:30.310 --> 00:34:32.190
Hahaha! Don't waste your time!

00:34:32.610 --> 00:34:34.130
Your power doesn't work on me!

00:34:35.040 --> 00:34:37.080
Anyway, Majinger Z, look behind you!

00:34:37.680 --> 00:34:37.820
Hm?

00:34:38.100 --> 00:34:38.260
Ah!

00:34:39.470 --> 00:34:52.500
So you're the Majinger Z!

00:34:53.500 --> 00:34:54.480
Who are you?

00:34:54.680 --> 00:34:57.750
I'm Jyuma Shogun, the leader of the Mikene Dark Grand Shogun!

00:34:57.890 --> 00:34:59.700
In order to send you to hell...

00:35:00.000 --> 00:35:00.940
Don't make me laugh!

00:35:01.240 --> 00:35:02.660
The opponent is a robot like a toy!

00:35:03.200 --> 00:35:03.700
Smash it!

00:35:04.460 --> 00:35:06.360
Don't mess with me! High-power beam!

00:35:43.630 --> 00:35:45.820
I don't have a hand.

00:35:46.330 --> 00:35:49.060
Give up and escape with the pilot.

00:35:49.940 --> 00:35:52.770
Damn it! I'll go save him!

00:35:53.410 --> 00:35:55.070
But I won't get in the way now.

00:35:55.410 --> 00:35:56.780
Boss, fly in the sky!

00:35:57.440 --> 00:35:58.140
What? How?

00:35:58.520 --> 00:35:59.360
Just come with me!

00:36:00.280 --> 00:36:00.580
That's too much!

00:36:14.800 --> 00:36:17.380
With a toy like that, you can't beat a Mikaene fighter!

00:36:18.680 --> 00:36:20.790
I don't have time to play with such a robot!

00:36:21.310 --> 00:36:22.250
I'll crush it!

00:36:22.650 --> 00:36:25.750
Jyuma Shogun, this guy has a grudge against his friends.

00:36:26.290 --> 00:36:27.610
Please leave it to me.

00:36:27.810 --> 00:36:29.710
Alright, I'll leave it to you. Do it!

00:36:30.000 --> 00:36:31.900
Boost Hurricane!

00:36:32.340 --> 00:36:48.140
Get rid of it! I'm going to save you!

00:36:48.360 --> 00:36:49.900
Orot, fire!

00:37:07.930 --> 00:37:08.170
Here we go!

00:37:30.920 --> 00:37:31.880
That was a quick return!

00:38:17.080 --> 00:38:18.780
I can't let Zinger Z fall to the ground!

00:38:19.500 --> 00:38:29.220
Dandaran! Dandaran!

00:38:30.000 --> 00:38:31.340
Tsurugi Tetsuya, the time has come!

00:38:31.880 --> 00:38:34.640
Let's launch the Great Majinga and crush the seven troops of the Dark General!

00:38:37.380 --> 00:38:38.380
Majinga!

00:38:38.740 --> 00:38:42.320
Don't let your tears run dry!

00:39:07.390 --> 00:39:09.220
You're no match for me, I'll finish you!

00:39:52.940 --> 00:39:55.380
I'll finish you off with the Arthost Brunger Mazinger Z!

00:39:56.400 --> 00:39:57.300
I'll crush the rest of you!

00:40:04.480 --> 00:40:05.420
Magima Jet, use this!

00:41:28.900 --> 00:41:29.860
I left it to you!

00:41:30.000 --> 00:41:32.000
Thank you for watching!

00:41:45.132 --> 00:41:47.432
But I'm not afraid of the seven armies that I'm proud of!

00:41:47.756 --> 00:41:50.116
From now on, I'll erase you from my life!

00:42:00.800 --> 00:42:02.560
You're strong. What's your robot called?

00:42:03.100 --> 00:42:04.640
The Great Majinger.

00:42:04.780 --> 00:42:06.900
The Great Majinger?

00:42:07.060 --> 00:42:08.570
It's the brother of the Majinger Z.

00:42:09.310 --> 00:42:09.710
Brother?

00:42:10.750 --> 00:42:12.850
It was made to fight the seven armies of Mikene.

00:42:13.870 --> 00:42:14.270
What?

00:42:15.130 --> 00:42:17.290
Let's meet again, Majinger Z.

00:42:36.330 --> 00:42:38.960
K and Majinga, you are truly great.

00:42:40.130 --> 00:42:41.630
Who made such a powerful robot?
